    {
      "index": 1,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "分類APIを振り分けに使うなら、しきい値付近をどう扱いますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-01.mp3",
      "audioHash": "f94271f85ce08ff9c35bbfccf5c83b93c6b853c204db6770c2b8b58bc82d753f",
